# Copy these settings to the root .env used by Docker Compose.
# Alerts and Telegram must also be enabled and configured.
Ntfy__Enabled=true
Ntfy__Server=https://ntfy.amitzi.xyz/
Ntfy__Topic=GastosApp
# Replace with a token authorized to publish to GastosApp. Never commit a real token.
Ntfy__Token=SET_FROM_ENV

# Automatic Telegram alerts are mirrored to ntfy; bot command replies are not.
# Telegram retains its existing outbox retries. ntfy is best-effort after Telegram
# succeeds: ntfy failures are logged by exception type only, without retrying Telegram.
# No historical sent alerts are replayed. Disabling Ntfy__Enabled restores Telegram-only delivery.
# Local dotnet run does not load .env: export these variables in the shell instead.
